IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- Telecommunications Act 1999 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation (TA1999.txt).
-- PART 2: s 6 (spectrum right), s 7 (satellite orbital slots), s 8 (designation of public telecommunication licensees).
-- The seat is the holder's: what may I be required to do, what must I pay, what protects the grant from challenge.
-- 2000 Revised Edition numbers: s 6 was s 5A, s 7 was s 5B, s 8 was s 6.

§ `s 6 Power to grant spectrum right`

-- src:719 | 6.—(1) The Authority may, with the consent of or in accordance
-- src:720 | with the terms of a general authority given by the Minister, grant any
-- src:721 | spectrum right —
-- src:723 | (a) unconditionally or subject to such conditions as the
-- src:724 | Authority may impose and specify in the grant of the
-- src:725 | spectrum right, including conditions on the sharing and
-- src:726 | trading of radio frequency spectrum; and
-- src:728 | (b) irrevocably or subject to revocation as specified in the
-- src:729 | grant of the spectrum right for the allocation and use of the
-- src:730 | radio frequency spectrum specified in the grant.
@ref s 6(1) (src:719-730)
GIVEN `the Minister consented or a general authority given by the Minister covers the grant` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(1): the Authority may grant the spectrum right` MEANS
    `the Minister consented or a general authority given by the Minister covers the grant`

GIVEN `the grant specifies conditions, including conditions on the sharing and trading of radio frequency spectrum` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(1)(a): the spectrum right is held subject to this condition` MEANS
    `the grant specifies conditions, including conditions on the sharing and trading of radio frequency spectrum`

GIVEN `the grant specifies that it is revocable` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(1)(b): the spectrum right is revocable` MEANS
    `the grant specifies that it is revocable`

-- src:734 | (2) A spectrum right may be granted under subsection (1) to any
-- src:735 | person or class of persons, or to a particular person.
@ref s 6(2) (src:734-735)
GIVEN `the grantee is a person, a class of persons or a particular person` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(2): the spectrum right may be granted to this grantee` MEANS
    `the grantee is a person, a class of persons or a particular person`

-- src:739 | (3) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Authority may, subject to
-- src:740 | the regulations made under section 97, specify, in such form and
-- src:741 | manner as the Authority thinks fit —
-- src:743 | (a) the procedure and requirements for the grant of a spectrum
-- src:744 | right under subsection (1);
-- src:746 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:747 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 16
-- src:749 | (b) the conditions for participating in the process for the
-- src:750 | allocation of the spectrum right; and
-- src:752 | (c) the fees and charges payable, or the manner of determining
-- src:753 | the fees and charges payable, for the grant of the spectrum
-- src:754 | right.
@ref s 6(3) (src:739-754)
GIVEN `the Authority specifies it in such form and manner as it thinks fit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is consistent with the regulations made under section 97` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is the procedure and requirements for the grant, the conditions for participating in the allocation process, or the fees and charges payable (or the manner of determining them)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(3): the Authority may specify this for the grant of a spectrum right` MEANS
    `the Authority specifies it in such form and manner as it thinks fit` AND `it is consistent with the regulations made under section 97` AND `it is the procedure and requirements for the grant, the conditions for participating in the allocation process, or the fees and charges payable (or the manner of determining them)`

-- src:758 | (4) Without affecting subsection (3), the Authority may employ
-- src:759 | any, or any combination, of the following methods to determine the
-- src:760 | grant of a spectrum right:
-- src:762 | (a) auction;
-- src:764 | (b) tender;
-- src:766 | (c) allocation of the spectrum right in exchange for such fees
-- src:767 | or charges as determined or negotiated by the Authority.
@ref s 6(4) (src:758-767)
GIVEN method IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(4): the Authority may use this method to determine the grant of a spectrum right` MEANS
    elem method (LIST "auction", "tender", "allocation of the spectrum right in exchange for fees or charges determined or negotiated by the Authority")

-- src:771 | (5) The grant of a spectrum right to a person under subsection (1) is
-- src:772 | subject to the person paying to the Authority such fees or charges as
-- src:773 | may be specified, or as may be determined in the manner specified,
-- src:774 | by the Authority under subsection (3)(c).
@ref s 6(5) (src:771-774)
GIVEN `the person has paid the fees or charges specified, or determined in the manner specified, by the Authority under subsection (3)(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(5): the grant of the spectrum right is effective as to payment` MEANS
    `the person has paid the fees or charges specified, or determined in the manner specified, by the Authority under subsection (3)(c)`

-- src:778 | (6) A person who is granted a spectrum right under subsection (1)
-- src:779 | must also pay to the Authority such other fees or charges for the grant,
-- src:780 | or such periodic fees or charges for the duration of the grant, or both,
-- src:781 | as may be specified, or as may be determined in the manner specified,
-- src:782 | by the Authority under subsection (3)(c).
@ref s 6(6) (src:778-782)
GIVEN `the fee or charge is specified, or determined in the manner specified, by the Authority under subsection (3)(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is another fee or charge for the grant, or a periodic fee or charge for the duration of the grant` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(6): the holder must pay this fee or charge to the Authority` MEANS
    `the fee or charge is specified, or determined in the manner specified, by the Authority under subsection (3)(c)` AND `it is another fee or charge for the grant, or a periodic fee or charge for the duration of the grant`

-- src:786 | (7) The fees or charges payable by a person to the Authority under
-- src:787 | subsections (5) and (6) are recoverable by the Authority from the
-- src:788 | person as a debt due to the Authority.
@ref s 6(7) (src:786-788)
GIVEN `the fee or charge is payable under subsection (5) or (6)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(7): the Authority may recover the fee or charge as a debt due to it` MEANS
    `the fee or charge is payable under subsection (5) or (6)`

-- src:792 | (8) No person is to question whether the grant of a spectrum right
-- src:793 | under subsection (1) was, or was not, effected with the consent of or
-- src:794 | in accordance with the terms of a general authority given by the
-- src:795 | Minister, and the validity of a spectrum right granted under that
-- src:796 | subsection must not be impugned on the ground that it was granted
-- src:798 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:799 | 17 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:801 | neither with the consent of nor in accordance with the terms of a
-- src:802 | general authority given by the Minister.
@ref s 6(8) (src:792-802)
GIVEN `the spectrum right was granted neither with the consent of the Minister nor in accordance with the terms of a general authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(8): the validity of the spectrum right may be impugned on the ground that it was granted without the Minister's consent` MEANS
    FALSE

-- src:806 | (9) The grant of spectrum rights under subsection (1) is at the
-- src:807 | discretion of the Authority.
@ref s 6(9) (src:806-807)
GIVEN `the Authority decides to grant` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(9): a spectrum right is granted` MEANS
    `the Authority decides to grant`

-- src:811 | (10) This section does not prevent the Minister from directing the
-- src:812 | Authority to grant a spectrum right in any specific case.
@ref s 6(10) (src:811-812)
GIVEN `the Minister directs the Authority to grant a spectrum right in a specific case` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(10): section 6 prevents the Minister from giving the direction` MEANS
    FALSE

-- src:816 | (11) Anything done under and in accordance with a spectrum right
-- src:817 | granted under subsection (1) does not constitute an infringement of
-- src:818 | the privilege conferred by section 3.
@ref s 6(11) (src:816-818)
GIVEN `done under and in accordance with a spectrum right granted under s 6(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(11): the act is not an infringement of the privilege conferred by section 3` MEANS
    `done under and in accordance with a spectrum right granted under s 6(1)`

-- src:822 | (12) For the purposes of giving effect to this section or any of the
-- src:823 | regulations referred to in subsection (13), the Authority may give
-- src:824 | directions to any person who has been granted a spectrum right under
-- src:825 | subsection (1) concerning the use of the spectrum right.
@ref s 6(12) (src:822-825)
GIVEN `the person has been granted a spectrum right under s 6(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the direction concerns the use of the spectrum right and is given to give effect to section 6 or the regulations under subsection (13)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(12): the Authority may give this direction to the person` MEANS
    `the person has been granted a spectrum right under s 6(1)` AND `the direction concerns the use of the spectrum right and is given to give effect to section 6 or the regulations under subsection (13)`

-- src:829 | (13) For the purposes of giving effect to this section, the Authority
-- src:830 | may by regulations made under section 97 —
-- src:832 | (a) provide for the exclusion of any person from participation,
-- src:833 | or limiting the person’s participation, in the process of
-- src:834 | allocation of any spectrum right;
-- src:836 | (b) without affecting subsection (1)(a), specify the types of
-- src:837 | conditions that the Authority may impose on the grant of
-- src:838 | any spectrum right;
-- src:840 | (c) provide for the variation of the conditions of the grant of
-- src:841 | any spectrum right;
-- src:843 | (d) provide for the resumption, by agreement or compulsorily,
-- src:844 | of any spectrum right or part of any spectrum right;
-- src:846 | (e) provide for the suspension or cancellation of the grant of
-- src:847 | any spectrum right or part of any spectrum right and the
-- src:848 | grounds for suspension or cancellation; and
-- src:850 | (f) impose on a person who is granted any spectrum right, for
-- src:851 | the breach of any of the conditions of that grant or of any
-- src:853 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:854 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 18
-- src:856 | direction issued under this section, a financial penalty of an
-- src:857 | amount not exceeding the higher of the following amounts:
-- src:859 | (i) 10% of the annual turnover of that part of the
-- src:860 | person’s business in respect of which the person is
-- src:861 | granted the spectrum right, as ascertained from the
-- src:862 | person’s latest audited accounts; or
-- src:864 | (ii) $1 million.
@ref s 6(13) (src:829-864)
GIVEN matter IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 6(13)(a) to (e): the Authority may by regulations made under section 97 provide for this matter` MEANS
    elem matter (LIST "the exclusion of a person from participation, or the limiting of the person's participation, in the allocation of a spectrum right"
                    , "the types of conditions that the Authority may impose on the grant of a spectrum right"
                    , "the variation of the conditions of the grant of a spectrum right"
                    , "the resumption, by agreement or compulsorily, of a spectrum right or part of one"
                    , "the suspension or cancellation of the grant of a spectrum right or part of one, and the grounds")

GIVEN `annual turnover in dollars of that part of the person's business in respect of which the spectrum right is granted, from the latest audited accounts` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 6(13)(f): the most the financial penalty may be for breach of a condition of the grant or of a direction, in dollars` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`annual turnover in dollars of that part of the person's business in respect of which the spectrum right is granted, from the latest audited accounts` TIMES 0.1) GREATER THAN 1000000
           THEN `annual turnover in dollars of that part of the person's business in respect of which the spectrum right is granted, from the latest audited accounts` TIMES 0.1
           OTHERWISE 1000000

§ `s 7 Power to license satellite orbital slots`

-- src:872 | 7.—(1) The Authority may, with the consent of or in accordance
-- src:873 | with the terms of a general authority given by the Minister, grant a
-- src:874 | licence for the use of any satellite orbital slot —
-- src:876 | (a) unconditionally or subject to such conditions as the
-- src:877 | Authority may impose and specify in the licence; and
-- src:879 | (b) irrevocably or subject to revocation as specified in the
-- src:880 | licence.
@ref s 7(1) (src:872-880)
GIVEN `the Minister consented or a general authority given by the Minister covers the grant` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(1): the Authority may grant a licence for the use of a satellite orbital slot` MEANS
    `the Minister consented or a general authority given by the Minister covers the grant`

GIVEN `the licence specifies that it is revocable` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(1)(b): the licence for the satellite orbital slot is revocable` MEANS
    `the licence specifies that it is revocable`

-- src:884 | (2) A licence under subsection (1) —
-- src:886 | (a) may be granted to any person or class of persons, or to a
-- src:887 | particular person; and
-- src:889 | (b) may include (without affecting the power to impose
-- src:890 | conditions conferred by that subsection) conditions
-- src:891 | requiring —
-- src:893 | (i) the licensee to enter into agreements or arrangements
-- src:894 | with any person or class of persons, or with another
-- src:895 | telecommunication licensee, for coordination of
-- src:896 | radio frequencies;
-- src:898 | (ii) the licensee to comply with any direction given by
-- src:899 | the Authority as to such matters as are specified in
-- src:900 | the licence, or as are of a description specified in the
-- src:901 | licence;
-- src:903 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:904 | 19 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:906 | (iii) the licensee to comply with codes of practice and
-- src:907 | standards of performance that are applicable to the
-- src:908 | licensee; and
-- src:910 | (iv) the licensee to do, or to refrain from doing, such
-- src:911 | things as are specified in the licence, or as are of a
-- src:912 | description specified in the licence.
@ref s 7(2) (src:884-912)
GIVEN `the grantee is a person, a class of persons or a particular person` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(2)(a): the licence may be granted to this grantee` MEANS
    `the grantee is a person, a class of persons or a particular person`

GIVEN `the licence includes a condition requiring the licensee to enter into agreements or arrangements with a person, a class of persons or another telecommunication licensee for coordination of radio frequencies` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(2)(b)(i): the licensee is required to enter into the agreement or arrangement for coordination of radio frequencies` MEANS
    `the licence includes a condition requiring the licensee to enter into agreements or arrangements with a person, a class of persons or another telecommunication licensee for coordination of radio frequencies`

GIVEN `the licence includes a condition requiring compliance with directions of the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the direction is as to a matter specified in the licence or of a description so specified` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(2)(b)(ii): the licensee must comply with the Authority's direction` MEANS
    `the licence includes a condition requiring compliance with directions of the Authority` AND `the direction is as to a matter specified in the licence or of a description so specified`

GIVEN `the licence includes a condition requiring compliance with codes of practice and standards of performance` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the code of practice or standard of performance is applicable to the licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(2)(b)(iii): the licensee must comply with the code of practice or standard of performance` MEANS
    `the licence includes a condition requiring compliance with codes of practice and standards of performance` AND `the code of practice or standard of performance is applicable to the licensee`

GIVEN `the licence includes a condition requiring the licensee to do or to refrain from doing things` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the thing is specified in the licence or is of a description specified in the licence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(2)(b)(iv): the licensee must do, or refrain from doing, the thing` MEANS
    `the licence includes a condition requiring the licensee to do or to refrain from doing things` AND `the thing is specified in the licence or is of a description specified in the licence`

-- src:916 | (3) The grant of a licence under subsection (1) is subject to the
-- src:917 | payment to the Authority of such fees for the grant of the licence as
-- src:918 | may be prescribed.
@ref s 7(3) (src:916-918)
GIVEN `the prescribed fee for the grant of the licence has been paid to the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(3): the grant of the licence is effective as to payment` MEANS
    `the prescribed fee for the grant of the licence has been paid to the Authority`

-- src:922 | (4) A licensee must also pay to the Authority such other fees for the
-- src:923 | licence, or such periodic fees for the duration of the licence, or
-- src:924 | both —
-- src:926 | (a) as may be prescribed; or
-- src:928 | (b) if not prescribed, as may be specified by the Authority in
-- src:929 | the licence conditions.
@ref s 7(4) (src:922-929)
GIVEN `the fee is prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the fee is specified by the Authority in the licence conditions` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(4): the licensee must pay this other or periodic fee to the Authority` MEANS
    `the fee is prescribed` OR ((NOT `the fee is prescribed`) AND `the fee is specified by the Authority in the licence conditions`)

-- src:933 | (5) Any fees payable under subsection (3) or (4) in respect of a
-- src:934 | licence —
-- src:936 | (a) need not bear any relationship to the cost of granting or
-- src:937 | administering the licence; and
@ref s 7(5)(a) (src:933-937)
GIVEN `the fee is payable under subsection (3) or (4)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(5)(a): the fee must bear a relationship to the cost of granting or administering the licence` MEANS
    FALSE

-- src:939 | (b) are recoverable by the Authority from the licensee as a debt
-- src:940 | due to the Authority.
@ref s 7(5)(b) (src:939-940)
GIVEN `the fee is payable under subsection (3) or (4)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(5)(b): the Authority may recover the fee from the licensee as a debt due to the Authority` MEANS
    `the fee is payable under subsection (3) or (4)`

-- src:944 | (6) A licensee is not entitled to the refund of any fee paid under
-- src:945 | subsection (3) or (4) if —
-- src:947 | (a) the licence is cancelled or suspended, or if the period of the
-- src:948 | licence is reduced, under section 10; or
-- src:950 | (b) the licence is terminated at the request of the licensee.
@ref s 7(6) (src:944-950)
GIVEN `the licence is cancelled or suspended, or the period of the licence is reduced, under section 10` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the licence is terminated at the request of the licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 7(6): the licensee is entitled to the refund of a fee paid under subsection (3) or (4)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the licence is cancelled or suspended, or the period of the licence is reduced, under section 10` OR `the licence is terminated at the request of the licensee`
           THEN JUST FALSE
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:954 | (7) No person is to question whether the grant of a licence under
-- src:955 | subsection (1) was, or was not, effected with the consent of or in
-- src:956 | accordance with the terms of a general authority given by the
-- src:957 | Minister, and the validity of a licence granted under that subsection
-- src:959 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:960 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 20
-- src:962 | must not be impugned on the ground that it was granted neither with
-- src:963 | the consent of nor in accordance with the terms of a general authority
-- src:964 | given by the Minister.
@ref s 7(7) (src:954-964)
GIVEN `the licence was granted neither with the consent of the Minister nor in accordance with the terms of a general authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(7): the validity of the licence may be impugned on the ground that it was granted without the Minister's consent` MEANS
    FALSE

-- src:968 | (8) The grant of licences under this section is at the discretion of the
-- src:969 | Authority.
@ref s 7(8) (src:968-969)
GIVEN `the Authority decides to grant` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(8): a licence for a satellite orbital slot is granted` MEANS
    `the Authority decides to grant`

-- src:973 | (9) This section does not prevent the Minister from directing the
-- src:974 | Authority to grant a licence in any specific case.
@ref s 7(9) (src:973-974)
GIVEN `the Minister directs the Authority to grant a licence in a specific case` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(9): section 7 prevents the Minister from giving the direction` MEANS
    FALSE

§ `s 8 Designation of public telecommunication licensees`

-- src:982 | 8. The Authority may, with the approval of the Minister, designate
-- src:983 | any person who has been granted a licence under section 5 as a public
-- src:984 | telecommunication licensee to perform all or any of the functions
-- src:985 | relating to the operation and provision of telecommunication systems
-- src:986 | and services in Singapore within the exclusive privilege of the
-- src:987 | Authority under this Act.
@ref s 8 (src:982-987)
GIVEN `the Minister approved the designation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has been granted a licence under section 5` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 8: the Authority may designate the person as a public telecommunication licensee` MEANS
    `the Minister approved the designation` AND `the person has been granted a licence under section 5`
